#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "Defining custom machine learning CV with metatomic"
msgstr "metatomic による独自の Machine Learning CV の定義"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"[Metatomic](https://docs.metatensor.org/metatomic/) is a library to use "
"arbitrary machine learning models together with arbitrary simulation tools. "
"Here we show how to use the interface between metatomic and plumed to define"
" fully custom collective variables (CV). These CV can be defined using "
"typical machine learning tools, but any Python function based on PyTorch "
"will also work, allowing to define new CV extremely easily."
msgstr ""
"[Metatomic](https://docs.metatensor.org/metatomic/) は、任意の Machine Learning "
"モデルを任意のシミュレーションツールと組み合わせて使うためのライブラリである。ここでは、metatomic と PLUMED "
"のインターフェースを用いて、完全に独自の Collective Variables（CV）を定義する方法を示す。これらの CV は一般的な "
"Machine Learning ツールで定義できるほか、PyTorch に基づく任意の Python 関数でも定義できるため、新しい CV "
"を極めて容易に作成できる。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:10
msgid ""
"Through the use of PyTorch, you can focus on defining the CV itself, and "
"automatically get its gradients. You can also execute the code computing "
"your CV on GPUs and other accelerators."
msgstr ""
"PyTorch を使うことで、CV 自体の定義に集中し、Gradients は自動的に得られる。また、CV を計算するコードを GPU やその他の "
"Accelerator 上で実行できる。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:14
msgid ""
"Other tools are able to interact with CV defined as metatomic models, most "
"notably [chemiscope](https://chemiscope.org). You can therefore visualize "
"how complex CV act on representative structures before even starting a "
"simulation, and improve the Cv interactively."
msgstr ""
"metatomic モデルとして定義した CV は、他のツール、特に [chemiscope](https://chemiscope.org) "
"とも連携できる。そのため、シミュレーションを始める前に、複雑な CV が代表的な構造に対してどのように働くかを可視化し、対話的に改善できる。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:19
msgid "Free-energy surface of LJ38 cluster"
msgstr "LJ38 Cluster の自由エネルギー面"

#: NAVIGATION.md:21
msgid ""
"The cluster of 38 atoms interacting through a Lennard-Jones potential is an "
"interesting benchmark system for collective variables, because its global "
"minimum energy structure is a truncated octahedron with `O_h` symmetry. The "
"potential energy surface also has a multi-funnel landscape, meaning the "
"system can easily get trapped in other local minima."
msgstr ""
"Lennard-Jones Potential で相互作用する38原子の Cluster は、Collective Variables の興味深い "
"Benchmark 系である。Global Minimum Energy Structure が `O_h` 対称性を持つ Truncated "
"Octahedron だからである。Potential Energy Surface は Multi-funnel Landscape "
"も持つため、系は他の Local Minima に容易に捕捉される。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:27
msgid ""
"This tutorial contains a hands-on interactive tutorial (that you can also "
"download and run locally) that defines two different collective variables to"
" drive metadynamics for this system. The first CV is based on the histogram "
"of coordination number, and the second one uses a machine learning "
"representation (the SOAP spherical expansion) as a basis to define "
"Steinhardt oder parameters-like CVs."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、この系の Metadynamics を駆動する2種類の Collective Variables "
"を定義する、対話型の実習を行う。ダウンロードして手元でも実行できる。1つ目の CV は Coordination Number の Histogram "
"に基づく。2つ目は Machine Learning Representation（SOAP Spherical "
"Expansion）を基底として、Steinhardt Order Parameters に似た CVs を定義する。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:67
msgid ""
"Depending on your previous experience, you may want to follow the lessons on"
" metadynamics first."
msgstr "これまでの経験に応じて、先に Metadynamics のレッスンを学ぶとよい。"

